        <mxCell id="cho_a" value="nome = &quot;Chopp&quot;&lt;br&gt;precoBase = 12.0&lt;br&gt;volumeMl = 500&lt;br&gt;alcoolica = true" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="cho">
